bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:1:## Elementsd
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:2:* `Dockerfile` downloads the compiled binaries from https://github.com/ElementsProject/elements/releases
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:3:* Whereas `Dockerfile.gitian` uses [gitian](https://github.com/devrandom/gitian-builder) to build from [source](https://github.com/ElementsProject/elements)
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:5:You can update Elements' version in the `Dockerfile` and/or `run-gitian.sh` based on the version you want to build (e.g. `v0.18.1` or `commit_hash`).
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:10:docker run -itd --name ub -v `pwd`/elementsd:/opt/elementsd -v /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock ubuntu:bionic sleep infinity
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:22:cd /opt/elementsd 
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:25:You can watch the install or build logs by running `docker exec ub tail -f /opt/elementsd/gitian/var/install|build.log` in another terminal window.
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:28:Lastly, you can build the Docker image(s) with the Elements binaries by specifying the appropriate Dockerfile:
bitcoin-images/elementsd/README.md:30:docker build -t blockstream/elementsd:tag_or_commit -f Dockerfile.gitian .
